abstract: >
  Code and reproducibility materials for the paper
  "Evaluating Machine-Learning Models for Multiclass Classification of
  LIGO Gravitational-Wave Glitches." The repository contains model
  scripts, lightweight numerical evidence, figure assets, and
  documentation for the original benchmark and its 2026
  referee-driven revision.
